# "Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, you may sacrifice it. If you do, proliferate." Bot2 Lightning
# Bolts the Scamp with its combat damage trigger on the stack; it dies (its dies trigger hits Bot2 for its power, 1). As
# the damage trigger resolves there is no Scamp to sacrifice (CR 400.7, 701.21a), so the sacrifice is an impossible
# option and isn't offered (CR 608.2d): Bot1 isn't asked, and nothing proliferates (Bot2's Liliana of the Veil keeps 3
# loyalty). Bot2: 20 - 1 combat damage - 1 from the dies trigger = 18.

[Bot1 Deck]
Cacophony Scamp
Mountain x7
Mountain x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Liliana of the Veil
Lightning Bolt
Swamp x19

